  "body": "The Element.webidl has a CEReactions annotation on |attribute DOMTokenList classList|[1]. It seems like an oversight bug, because [CEReactions] is no longer allowed on [PutForwards] readonly attributes[2].\r\n\r\n\r\n[1] https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/4ba35d93cff40fd3d3137ed44e803df17296a8cd/#interface-element\r\n[2] https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2362  \r\n\r\n/cc @domenic , @annevk ",
